==Battleground==
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With multiple wavers and a Lowkey who slowly creeps up and curses your Cats, this stage can be difficult without the right units and levels. Ideally, one should bring a Wave Blocker, most notably [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], who can be spammed frequently and hard-counters the Pigeons with its Resist versus Floating enemies. The Curse Immune [[Talents|Talent]] is also recommended for higher difficulties for Octopus to tank Lowkey better. Beat up the peons using attackers like [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], Talented [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Try to kill or deal as much damage to the first Kory as possible before the second one spawns. In higher difficulties, [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] is especially very potent as his anti-Traitless capabilities and Wave Immunity make him insanely strong versus Kory and Dober.

If you have [[Brainwashed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Flying]] at a high level, Dober can be rushed down in combination with [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]]'s explosion talents by being lured to the base. Afterwards, dealing with the Kories without the threat of Dober will be easier.

